          "to": 998,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-23d7bcc0c366f31ae1193a85eedc49c22a8cec43e8f363b4665269cb599cf0e0"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:2ecba933-2481-40d0-8949-87a2020e9b86",
      "claimId": "claim:550f32d0-c0cc-441a-888d-c1703ba52b91",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:60435ee7-a6be-4457-92ca-87578f18b5a2",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex:998-1002, accounting main.tex:1034 via main.tex",
        "from": 929,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-ef3af4d59735b7277bc862170a8cb4247b6a2d9bf42c2e7d8693870c746beac7"
      },
      "text": "The run performs Õ(|V| d² (q + d + d²|V|²/ε² log(|V|/η))² + |V| d^{2ω}) arithmetic operations (Lean: d³ in place of d² in the first term with Program.build unchanged)",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-c710400433769927d0425c64feb322fb45f7645924d360be6aa22d1e5c173ad4",
      "kind": "time",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "main.tex:998-1002, accounting main.tex:1034 via main.tex",
          "from": 929,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-ef3af4d59735b7277bc862170a8cb4247b6a2d9bf42c2e7d8693870c746beac7"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:82f1a7f9-7bf8-4030-b7d3-ca8b74762ff4",
      "claimId": "claim:715f74d0-e4d1-4c57-8a6b-88a81481578e",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:60435ee7-a6be-4457-92ca-87578f18b5a2",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-35901824962538071557459f038346973aa859d49c44a8e3e1e3f6874223b0f9"
      },
      "text": "⟨a_TV, Φ_r(x)⟩ = P(x) − Q(x) pointwise, hence d_TV(P,Q) = ½ E(D_r, a_TV)",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-e5b80d39b5856612ef06184a76137039e1e33bf9fa473a17233f43b6c1a038d0",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
