        "excerptDigest": "sha256-eb9ace1f51be7fd1226ba0bd2314ca56b5fb3e587e5ce52f1878610448a66077"
      },
      "text": "The bottom-up DP computes Z_R: m_u^R = Σ_{x_{S_u}} h_u^R(x_{S_u}), m_r^R = Z_R",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-c122a239ab8788e29a68c610df1043999558454c5bbb1d622fbfce73f6329b2c",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
