        "excerptDigest": "sha256-96e086e68d05b11732d894891259deb96e640598854738d13ee8438e7691eb25"
      },
      "text": "The two-layer scalar subcircuit computes the bilinear gate, i.e. the expanded circuit computes h_u^R",
